    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a classic 2D RPG in the style of Ashes of Immortality and Black Home.<br><br>As the last of a long lineage of Vampire Hunters, Beaumont Lacaster finds himself in the doorsteps of Nosferatu's Castle. By defeating him, he can rid humanity of the curse and evil of vampires.<br><br>Will he be able to defeat Nosferatu and fulfill his lineage's destiny or will he fall leaving humanity unprotected against heartless monsters?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br> * Touching storyline<br> * Semi-open world experience<br> * Beautiful locations to explore<br> * Quest Journal to keep track of your progress<br> * Mouse Support",
